    },
    {
      "text": "Beside a jade pool in Jade Pool blessed land, Guan Shen Zhao’s third eye picks out underworld eels in the clear water as visiting northern plains righteous path Gu Immortals gather. Tong Zu greets Dong Fang Chang Fan over their past charge into Snowy Mountain, and Chang Fan leads them into Modest Thatched Hut to seat a deduction transaction and a posthumous alliance with Dong Fang tribe.",
