    {
      "text": "Most super forces keep a main camp pieced together from Gu Immortals’ contributions. Like Dong Fang tribe’s Jade Pool, Murong tribe’s Yin-Yang, and Hei tribe’s Iron Eagle, Guan tribe’s Shi Huang blessed land is that kind of camp. Such pieced camps usually sit on the ground, take in earth qi to stabilize their space, and can slow time flow to postpone heavenly tribulations and earthly calamities.",
